":["houfei-e-o045b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0010","role":"设宴","evidence":["houfei-e-o045b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"毛氏立后以后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-o045b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o045b-q","source_order":[5,215,"O045b"],"order":1455},{"id":"houfei-e-o046a","title":"毛嘉卒追赠改封安国侯谥节侯","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o046a-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"毛嘉卒追赠改封安国侯谥节侯","evidence":["houfei-e-o046a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0010","role":"卒","evidence":["houfei-e-o046a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":235,"label":"青龙三年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"houfei-y235","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"houfei-q-o025","basis":"青龙三年"},"evidence":["houfei-e-o046a-q","houfei-q-o025","houfei-q-b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o046a-q","source_order":[5,216,"O046a"],"order":1456}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0010","name":"毛嘉","evidence":["mingdi-q-o007","houfei-q-o044"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"mingdi-m-o007-mingdi-p0010","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o007"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o044-mingdi-p0010","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o044"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o045-mingdi-p0010","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o045"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o046-mingdi-p0010","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o046"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o044c-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-ab194449d314cad9ca12","layer":"original","quote":"后父嘉，拜骑都尉；后弟曾，郎中。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-o045a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6a09e56b72ddc253ae5d","layer":"original","quote":"进嘉为奉车都尉，曾骑都尉，宠赐隆渥〖4〗。顷之，封嘉博平乡侯，迁光禄大夫；曾驸马都尉。嘉，本典虞车工〖5〗，猝暴富贵〖6〗。明帝令朝臣会其家饮宴，其容止举动甚蚩5〖7〗；语辄自谓“侯身”〖8〗，时人以为笑。﹝一﹞后又加嘉位特进，曾迁散骑侍郎。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-o045b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6a09e56b72ddc253ae5d","layer":"original","quote":"进嘉为奉车都尉，曾骑都尉，宠赐隆渥〖4〗。顷之，封嘉博平乡侯，迁光禄大夫；曾驸马都尉。嘉，本典虞车工〖5〗，猝暴富贵〖6〗。明帝令朝臣会其家饮宴，其容止举动甚蚩5〖7〗；语辄自谓“侯身”〖8〗，时人以为笑。﹝一﹞后又加嘉位特进，曾迁散骑侍郎。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-o046a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-57d03da0c132cfffd26d","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年，嘉薨。追赠光禄大夫，改封安国侯，增邑五百，并前千户，谥曰节侯。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92","layer":"modern","quote":"〖15〗三年：青龙三年（公元 235）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4aa0b3373c71cedadeb9","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o044","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-ab194449d314cad9ca12","layer":"original","quote":"大和元年，立为皇后。后父嘉，拜骑都尉；后弟曾，郎中。初，明帝为王，始纳河内虞氏为妃。帝即位，虞氏不得立为后，太皇卞太后慰勉焉。虞氏曰：“曹氏自好立贱〖1〗，未有能以义举者也。然后职内事〖2〗，君听外政，其道相由而成；苟不能以善始，未有能令终者也。殆必由此亡国丧祀矣〖3〗！”虞氏遂黜还邺宫。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o045","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6a09e56b72ddc253ae5d","layer":"original","quote":"进嘉为奉车都尉，曾骑都尉，宠赐隆渥〖4〗。顷之，封嘉博平乡侯，迁光禄大夫；曾驸马都尉。嘉，本典虞车工〖5〗，猝暴富贵〖6〗。明帝令朝臣会其家饮宴，其容止举动甚蚩5〖7〗；语辄自谓“侯身”〖8〗，时人以为笑。﹝一﹞后又加嘉位特进，曾迁散骑侍郎。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o046","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-57d03da0c132cfffd26d","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年，嘉薨。追赠光禄大夫，改封安国侯，增邑五百，并前千户，谥曰节侯。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o007d-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3b980088f10c9823d34d","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丙寅〖11〗，治兵于东郊。焉耆王遣子入侍〖12〗。十一月，立皇后毛氏〖13〗。赐天下男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独不能自存者，赐谷。十二月，封后父毛嘉为列侯。新城太守孟达反〖14〗，诏骠骑将军司马宣王讨之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o004","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o007","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3b980088f10c9823d34d","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丙寅〖11〗，治兵于东郊。焉耆王遣子入侍〖12〗。十一月，立皇后毛氏〖13〗。赐天下男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独不能自存者，赐谷。十二月，封后父毛嘉为列侯。新城太守孟达反〖14〗，诏骠骑将军司马宣王讨之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
